// ## 3. Android Configuration Files

// ### 3.1 `android/app/google-services.json`
// Place this file in `android/app/google-services.json`:

// ```json
// {
//   "project_info": {
//     "project_number": "882910482019",
//     "project_id": "fleetrunner-courier-prod",
//     "storage_bucket": "fleetrunner-courier-prod.firebasestorage.app"
